        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Southern Africa, Zimbabwe, Zambia, Ingombe Ilede\n- People: Cecil Rhodes\n- Topics: British protectorates, territorial division\n\nFacts:\n- Cecil Rhodes founded the southern Africa territory in 1875.\n- The southern Africa territory was a former British protectorate.\n- The territory later became two countries: Zimbabwe to the south and Zambia to the north.\n- A river near Ingombe Ilede marked the division between Zimbabwe and Zambia.",
